{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/mini-0.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div>\u00a0<strong>Dexterity Minesweeper! Sweep Carefully, Aim Precisely!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>DexSweeper</strong>, the cursor never stops moving. Use the your <strong>joystick</strong> or <strong>mouse</strong>\u00a0to guide your movement, then time your tile reveals carefully--one wrong move could be your last!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/mini-1.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div><strong>\u00a0Three Game Modes with Three Difficulty Levels each!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic</strong> Mode - Traditional Minesweeper without the crank mechanic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Guess</strong> Mode - Uses the crank but ensures you'll never face a 50/50 guess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Standard</strong> Mode - The full <strong>DexSweeper</strong> experience, with both dex control and classic Minesweeper strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/first.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mode includes three difficulty levels to challenge players of all skill levels:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beginner</strong> - A great starting point to learn the mechanics without pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intermediate</strong> - A balanced challenge for experienced sweepers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expert</strong> - The true test of speed, precision, and strategy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/second.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/mini-2.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div><strong>\u00a0Customize Your Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a variety of tile and cursor options to personalize your experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cursors</strong>: 2 animated + 10 static</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiles</strong>: 2 animated + 21 static</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/6173f848ef56dcddcf0c86be7c953a29.poster.avif?t=1753720044\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/6173f848ef56dcddcf0c86be7c953a29.gif?t=1753720044\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/extras/mini-3.gif?t=1753720044\" /></div><strong>\u00a0Can You Master the Perfect Clear?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With quick reflexes, smart deduction, and precise timing, you'll uncover the board and dodge deadly mines. <strong>How fast can you solve the grid?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819510?t=1753720044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819510?t=1753720044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819510/7754540fb499206dbc52197d59c91a4149ee6794/capsule_231x87.jpg